('page-11b19c6d-4634-4aaf-82ce-7e1f5fb35795', 53, 'paragraph', 'On May 19, I embarked on an unforgettable and wonderful 16-day trip to China organized by the company "Valley of the Kings" together with Professor Dr. Eyal Miron.

Roni and his wife Adi, thank you so much for all the organization before and during the trip; you were wonderful.
I also want to express my eternal gratitude to Professor Dr. Eyal Miron, who accompanied us throughout the trip as our guide. He shared his knowledge with rich details about each place we visited, sharing the details of the places and their stories. This made my trip unforgettable! And I hope to be with you on your next adventure!', null, '[]', '[]', null, null, null, null),
